      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just \"difficult\" though. it feels like a total mistake. i look around and everything is just... gone. the money, the status, the connections. even the people i thought were my friends turned their backs the second things got messy. i did the \"right\" thing and it just ruined me. i’m staring at a future where i have to start from zero while the people who actually did the fraud are still out there winning. i don't see the point in fighting a system that's this broken.",
